        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>1-1/4 Inch Helsinki Glass Door Knob Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHelsinki Glass Shower Door Handles are a Doorware.com exclusive. This Helsinki Shower Door Knob Set is perfect for your bathroom with its modern design. It is available in some of the hottest finishes in the industry including polished nickel and satin brass. The 1-1/4 inch diameter Helsinki Glass Door Knob Set is packaged with 2 knobs and a mounting kit for a 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch thick glass door. Add a contemporary shower pull to your bathroom for a sleek look that is sure to wow.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 1-1/4 Inch Diameter Helsinki Shower Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Glass Thickness: 1/4\" to 1/2\" Thick Glass.</li>\r\n<li>Glass Hole Diameter: 5/16\" - 3/8\" Hole Diameter.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-SD-HELSINKI32 Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
